

This is the version(s) of Tcl/Tk used by Max/Sue.

MMI (specifically, pat) made a number of custom
modifications to this version of Tcl/Tk.  The modified
files are in the directory mmi_custom.
There are symbolic links to these modified files in the
tcl/tk release directories, for example tk8.0.4/generic.

Do NOT delete mmi_custom!!!!!

The original releases build all unix objects in the "unix"
subdirectories of tcl8.0 and tk8.0.  Since we support multiple
versions, the objects are now built in sub-directories
with the OS name, and everything else is symlinked back
to the unix sub-directory.

To build everything, cd /mmi-cad/utils; make

The install.* dir was made by Lee to help with blt compile.

- pat -
